<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA 209 ALL OUT V AUSTRALIA.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA 209 ALL OUT V AUSTRALIA.</headline>
<dateline>PORT ELIZABETH, South Africa 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa were all out for 209 on the first day of the second test against Australia on Friday.</p>
